@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `tasco-vn19-nouns`

-- DANH SÁCH CƠ SỞ Y TẾ LOẠI TRỪ (the list of excluded medical facilities), as DATA: one L4 row per [in:tasco-excluded-facilities]
-- numbered row of the source.
-- Source: ../../source/raw/tasco-excluded-facilities.txt (pdftotext -layout), 2 pages, from
-- https://file-cdn.baohiemtasco.vn/cms/cms/danh-sach-co-so-y-te-loai-tru-1751438446.156.pdf,
-- sha256 e39c6d60...ce05fc9, RETRIEVED 2026-10-06. The upload timestamp in the URL decodes to
-- 2 July 2025; the list itself carries no date.
--
-- THE LIST CHANGES, and says so:
-- src:tasco-excluded-facilities:2 | Danh sách này được cập nhật thường xuyên trên website của BH Tasco
-- This is the list as published at its URL on 2026-10-06. The rules never refer to it: Article 11.5
-- excludes treatment at a facility that does not meet the definition in Article 2.17, and no clause
-- makes this list that definition or a part of the contract. So this encoding gives the list no
-- effect on cover; it is carried for a reader, with a lookup (NOTES.md fork F40, finding X20).
--
-- GENERATED, not typed: the rows below are the output of
--   python3 -I tools/annexes.py data-excluded BBOX.html ../../source/raw/tasco-excluded-facilities.txt
-- Row 20 runs over the page break; the -layout text prints its number and name on both pages
-- (lines 34 and 36) and the page image shows one row with three addresses. It is one row here.
-- A row can name several facilities (rows 17, 18, 22, 23, 29) and several addresses (rows 12, 20,
-- 30, 31). The address of row 31's second branch is cut off in the source ("Hồ Chí Min"). [in:tasco-excluded-facilities]
-- "Phòng khám Dr Allen" is on two rows, 12 (Hà Nội) and 37 (TP HCM). [in:tasco-excluded-facilities]

§ `The excluded-facility list`

-- src:tasco-excluded-facilities:1 | DANH SÁCH CƠ SỞ Y TẾ LOẠI TRỪ
-- src:tasco-excluded-facilities:5 | STT TỈNH HỆ THỐNG CSYT ĐỊA CHỈ CSYT

`the date the excluded-facility list was retrieved` MEANS YMD 2026 10 6

